@startuml
title Title screen states (titleMenu, titleScreen)
[*] --> MAIN
state MAIN : Continue (when a save exists)\nStart, Config, Exit
state CONFIG : save folder, music, sound,\nstories, demo times, Controls
state EDITING : typing a value (save folder, stories file)
state CONTROLS : key and pad bindings
state BINDING : waiting for a key or pad button
state Demo : autopilot plays a far chunk
state HallOfFame : top 10, shown for hallOfFameLength s
state Game : presentEverything(false)
state GameOver : name entry when the score qualifies

MAIN --> CONFIG : Config
CONFIG --> MAIN : Back / Esc
CONFIG --> EDITING : Enter on a text line
EDITING --> CONFIG : Enter (stored) / Esc
CONFIG --> CONTROLS : Controls
CONTROLS --> BINDING : Enter on an action
BINDING --> CONTROLS : key or button pressed
CONTROLS --> CONFIG : Back
MAIN --> Demo : idle demoWait + rand(demoWait) s
Demo --> MAIN : any press (DEMO_OVER)
Demo --> HallOfFame : demoLength s passed (DEMO_DONE)
HallOfFame --> MAIN : timeout or any press
MAIN --> Game : Start / Continue
Game --> MAIN : Esc (saved)
Game --> GameOver : last avatar lost
GameOver --> HallOfFame : shown with the new entry
MAIN --> [*] : Exit or window closed
@enduml
